  "implementationGuidance": [
    "Light mode only for MVP. No dark mode, no theme switch.",
    "Apply tokens as CSS custom properties in apps/web/src/index.css so component classes stay utility-only.",
    "Keep the sidebar at a fixed 240px and the header at 72px; the 1440 frame depends on both.",
    "Use a 36px page gutter, not Tailwind's default 32px (px-8).",
    "Prefer semantic layout (flex and grid with gaps) over absolute positioning. The Figma frames use absolute coordinates because they are static exports, not because the implementation should.",
    "Reuse the existing primitives in apps/web/src/components/ui/ rather than adding a second component set.",
    "Contrast: #171717 on #FFFFFF and #525252 on #FFFFFF both exceed WCAG AA. #A3A3A3 is placeholder-only and must not carry essential text."
  ]
